      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794121466393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "4. 解析msg的\\n。如果有多行，就执行每行然后拼接response。\n    把response回传给reactor。",
      "baseline": 52,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. 解析msg的\\n。如果有多行，就执行每行然后拼接response。\n    把response回传给reactor。"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 115,
      "versionNonce": 74053454,
