      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "recv_cb设计：循环拼接recv中的数据，querybuf动态拓展内存\n",
      "baseline": 47,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "recv_cb设计：循环拼接recv中的数据，querybuf动态拓展内存\n"
    },
    {
