      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794121466393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "process_buffer设计：",
      "baseline": 23,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "process_buffer设计："
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 321,
      "versionNonce": 1124720014,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "5aSNl6l1Xwuvta0PZ31n7",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1816.0678456025516,
      "y": 699.5654206191452,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 924,
      "height": 87,
      "seed": 1168889516,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794121466393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "问题：当前状态下，每次从rbuffer中拿出数据到querybuf中处理后又覆盖回rbuf，此时rbuf中是完整的命令\n然后设置OUT事件，rbuf中的数据给kvs协议处理。\n            把批量的返回响应写入wbuf，通过send发送",
      "baseline": 82,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "问题：当前状态下，每次从rbuffer中拿出数据到querybuf中处理后又覆盖回rbuf，此时rbuf中是完整的命令\n然后设置OUT事件，rbuf中的数据给kvs协议处理。\n            把批量的返回响应写入wbuf，通过send发送"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 1453,
      "versionNonce": 825690706,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "-iTuiZtd3TmQNVmeQICH4",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 229.49379715397134,
      "y": 485.2739124956173,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
