      "updated": 1794121466393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18.796992481202984,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "2. 每次recv_cb将数据阻塞发送到kv解析器，每次发送缓冲上限是1024\n\n\n",
      "baseline": 88,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. 每次recv_cb将数据阻塞发送到kv解析器，每次发送缓冲上限是1024\n\n\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 998,
      "versionNonce": 1767046094,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "krP7UGAHBCwzksMqOui6b",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 233.05340344689188,
      "y": 244.9681296242985,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "width": 553,
      "height": 197,
      "seed": 103983404,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794121466393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "3. 这次把批处理放在业务端：\n   （1）每次收到msg都先把数据存入动态缓冲区，\n循环查找缓冲区中\\n的位置\n   （2）解析到\\n，取出命令并执行。\n    （3）没解析到说明命令不完整，记录当前点等有数据来了，\n新数据的\\n并拼接\n   ",
      "baseline": 192,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. 这次把批处理放在业务端：\n   （1）每次收到msg都先把数据存入动态缓冲区，\n循环查找缓冲区中\\n的位置\n   （2）解析到\\n，取出命令并执行。\n    （3）没解析到说明命令不完整，记录当前点等有数据来了，\n新数据的\\n并拼接\n   "
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "version": 296,
      "versionNonce": 1178988562,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "id": "I7BflRic30TYylCPqKDiU",
      "fillStyle": "hachure",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "x": 1849.9592295142875,
      "y": 886.9428253890966,
      "strokeColor": "#000000",
