      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "1. malloc req 分配一个写请求\n2. memcpy 把cmd拷贝\n3. 加锁\n4. req->offset = 0\n    next_offset = 18\n5. 入队\n6. submitted++\n7. signal(cond)               -- >           唤醒worker线程",
      "baseline": 208,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. malloc req 分配一个写请求\n2. memcpy 把cmd拷贝\n3. 加锁\n4. req->offset = 0\n    next_offset = 18\n5. 入队\n6. submitted++\n7. signal(cond)               -- >           唤醒worker线程"
    },
